    "text": "grantcountyherald.com\nwebsite\nGlenwood\nBucs and Knights navigate hilly course at Minnewaska Area Invitational\n10 hours ago\nBoth Border West and West Central Area made the trip to Minnewaska Golf Course for the Minnewaska Area Invitational Oct. 7. For both teams, it was a chance for WCA to get an extra look at their Section 6A course. Karissa Anderson headlined the meet for the Bucs, winning the varsity girls competition. Carter Kjesbo was the quickest runner for the Knights, cracking the top-10 with a sixth place finish.",
